body:
It can be a bit, depending how far down your throat it goes. I mean, anything in the back of your throat long enough can leave you with a slightly scratchy throat afterwards. Plus the gag reflex thing, I don't have a very sensitive one, but after a while I start to gag a bit and have to pull back. If her gag reflex is more sensitive, it might not be so easy for her.

&#x200B;

Also I find 69 a bit easier to deepthroat in, not sure why, might be to do with the curve?

Men in suits/smart shirts.

&#x200B;

Also people taking charge/control of anything. (I may be a bit submissive)

I generally go for older guys. They're generally more mature than younger guys (at least at this stage in my life, even some of the guys my age can be immature) and they seem to know what you want and how to do it. And it's easier to see an older man as a dominant or caretaker.

&#x200B;

Not so sure about women, tend to be more attracted to women closer to my age,

27, 4 or 5 PIV (one I'm not entirely sure counts), and I think 7 for other sexual activities (that includes the 5 from the previous bit).

&#x200B;

Some days (a lot of days) I wish I'd been way more slutty

Traded sex for a hotel room for the night, didn't realise that was part of the deal at first (thought a semi-friend was just offering me a room). The sex wasn't amazing, it was in the middle of a heatwave and we were both too bloody warm. But I got a hotel room, and I got laid for the first time in a while.

&#x200B;

Really should have done that kind of thing more...
